WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.653
In one minute, you will sign up for one email a week with the lights near you.

00:00:04.653 --> 00:00:05.729
We start on the map.

00:00:06.632 --> 00:00:09.964
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:11.904 --> 00:00:14.327
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:14.327 --> 00:00:16.816
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:18.162
Tap Use my location.

00:00:19.898 --> 00:00:22.114
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:22.114 --> 00:00:22.766
Tap Allow.

00:00:26.342 --> 00:00:28.838
Look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:28.838 --> 00:00:30.055
See the three dots?

00:00:30.055 --> 00:00:30.603
Tap them.

00:00:32.204 --> 00:00:34.782
In the menu, tap Weekly lights email.

00:00:36.513 --> 00:00:39.050
Type your email address, and your city.

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:40.762
Then tick the box to agree.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:44.971
Tap Sign up.

00:00:47.141 --> 00:00:49.103
We send you an email to confirm.

00:00:49.103 --> 00:00:50.887
Nothing is sent until you do.

00:00:50.887 --> 00:00:52.017
Tap the link in it.

00:00:54.072 --> 00:00:54.839
That is it.

00:00:54.839 --> 00:00:57.715
Every weekly email ends with a link to stop.

00:00:57.715 --> 00:00:59.889
One tap, and you are off the list.

00:01:01.090 --> 00:01:04.306
Next up: Install the app and use it offline.
